69,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:29.74,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 1,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.81,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:29.89,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:34.91,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:29.99,0:01:30.43,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.13,0:01:30.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.37,0:01:30.84,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.06,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.31,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:31.01,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.07,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:47.45,Title,,0,0,240,,Gear FourthDialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:10.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Run! Run!Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:17.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Run to the center of the island!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-The buildings that haven't been sliced apart yet...Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:46.89,Main,,0,0,0,,...are being pushed by the cage and closing in on us!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:51.78,Main,,0,0,0,,The country's growing smaller and smaller!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:03:01.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace Grounds - Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:06.90,Main,,0,0,0,,The bird cage is shrinking?Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:09.30,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's what's causing all the commotion.Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:14.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the true terror of the bird cage, dear!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this! This is a really big deal!Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:23.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! I called him "dear" again!Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:28.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't just stand here and wait for death while sucking my thumb!Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:31.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Rouse our fallen allies right away!Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:32.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.05,0:03:37.92,Captions,,950,0,260,,Former Royal PlateauDialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:38.21,Main,,0,0,0,,If the battle lasts long enough, this plateau will be cut into pieces, too.Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:43.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! I thought this was the center of the country! Isn't this the safest place?Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.35,0:03:44.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at the sky!Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:48.06,Main,,0,0,0,,The center of the bird cage is shifting, little by little.Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:56.85,Main,,0,0,0,,The center of contraction is probably the current Royal Palace Grounds, where Doflamingo is!Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:04:01.45,Captions,,470,0,420,,Royal PalaceDialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:04:01.45,Captions,,0,405,170,,Current LocationDialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:01.64,Main,,0,0,0,,That means this place will eventually...Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:09.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Hack! Please hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop shaking me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:18.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We have finally descended, but there seems to be quite the commotion!Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That way, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:22.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro-dono!Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.33,0:04:26.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:28.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It's obvious, isn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:32.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stop it, of course!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:34.20,Main,,0,0,0,,That!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:35.16,Main,,0,0,0,,"That"?Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:44.27,Captions,,0,983,258,,Outside the Palace                Sunflower FieldDialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:48.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:51.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know there were dwarfs in Dressrosa.Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.80,0:04:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope your arm is reconnected properly.Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:57.74,Main,,0,0,0,,They said when blood starts flowing, it's cured.Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.54,0:05:01.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I know. I'm a doctor.Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:06.38,Main,,0,0,0,,When I saw the underground trade port, I understood.Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:12.71,Main,,0,0,0,,This battle...Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if we do take down Doflamingo, it won't be over.Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:22.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll cause tremendous ripples across the world.Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:26.58,Main,,0,0,0,,And you guys will be the eye of the storm.Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:29.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:31.99,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the plan.Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:53.00,Main,,0,0,0,,"Gear Fourth"?Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:54.06,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:15.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Muscle Balloon!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear...Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:49.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Fourth!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:59.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Bound-Man!Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:12.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, is this some kind of joke?Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.33,0:07:15.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You've grown quite large.Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you had an ace up your sleeve or something...Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:23.87,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't even stand up straight, being all rubber and bouncing like that.Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.87,0:07:27.72,Main,,0,0,0,,How're you gonna send me flying like that?Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:31.78,Main,,0,0,0,,For two years,Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:36.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I fought against monstrously huge, savage beasts!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:50.07,Main,,0,0,0,,To force them into submission,Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:53.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I needed this giant body and bounciness!Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:02.14,Main,,0,0,0,,How will bounciness help you...Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:07.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:12.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't...Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:17.28,Main,,0,0,0,,be able to do a damn thing!Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.78,0:08:25.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:29.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Kong...Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:34.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Gun!Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:04.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:05.24,Main,,0,0,0,,But why?Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Back off, back off!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:26.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you here, Doflamingo?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:29.64,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.42,0:09:36.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Run! He's gonna kill us all!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run! It's just the bird cage out there!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:48.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Downtown, eh?Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:50.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I was flung pretty far...Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:04.78,Main,,0,0,0,,He's bouncing off the air!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:12.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:17.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Rhino Schneider!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:27.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody else came!Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:30.90,Main,,0,0,0,,He's huge! And he kicked Doflamingo away!Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:42.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that ball-like guy?Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.20,0:10:54.91,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.91,0:11:01.83,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,By hardening his skin with the Color of Arms, he's multiplied its tension!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:11.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That ball bastard! He's nothing but rubber!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:26.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you! You're no match for Gear Fourth!Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.70,0:11:51.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:57.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Culverin!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.71,0:12:02.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Athlete String!Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:12.78,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's hardened, yet still rubbery?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:15.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Attacks like that...Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,won't work!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:22.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:24.77,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't get away, Mingo!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:26.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick your ass!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:32.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Why?! Now he just keeps stretching!Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:38.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep going after him, Python!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Enough! Down you go!Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:43.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:54.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Culverin!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.79,0:13:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That rubber ball is...Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.46,Main,,0,0,0,,...overwhelming...Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:40.97,Main,,0,0,0,,...Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.47,0:14:04.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that guy?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:05.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares who he is?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:06.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Go for it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:08.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You can do it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:16.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:15.68,Main,,0,0,3,,Did you see that?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:16.75,Main,,0,0,3,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:21.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how he changed. Is that really Straw Hat?Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:27.70,Main,,0,0,0,,He's overpowering the formidable Doflamingo! He's amazingly strong!Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:30.85,Main,,0,0,0,,But he's overusing his Haki.Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:34.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Overusing his... Haki?Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:42.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there he is.Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:44.98,Main,,0,0,0,,They went to play somewhere else.Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:48.84,Main,,0,0,0,,And here I took the trouble to come and watch them!Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:53.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Captain of the first ship of the Blackbeard Pirates, Jesus Burgess.Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:54.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.61,0:14:58.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Chase 'em or wait for 'em...Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:00.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Either way, I won't let 'em get away!Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:03.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get what I came for!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:09.33,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought, he's after Luffy-kun and the others.Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.33,0:15:10.69,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But what's he really after?Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.02,0:15:16.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,Corrida ColosseumDialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:17.14,Main,,0,0,3,,Viola.Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:20.51,Main,,0,0,0,,So, all that remains is the decisive battle between him and Luffy-kun?Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.51,0:15:22.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right, Father.Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.70,0:15:24.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Of those ranked commander and above,Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:27.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo is the only one remaining!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:31.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,SMILE FactoryDialogue: 0,0:15:27.31,0:15:30.11,Main,,0,0,3,,Outta the factory, Tontattas!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:33.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.45,0:15:37.88,Main,,0,0,0,,We're outta here! Get a super move on and get out!Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:49.87,Main,,0,0,0,,We've finished rescuing our stranded friends in the factory!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:51.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:16:00.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The factory is tilting!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:05.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Fraland! Why is the Smile Factory the only building that isn't being cut up?Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:07.41,Main,,0,0,0,,"Only" the factory?Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:10.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I get it, it's the Sea Stone!Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.61,0:16:11.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Sea Stone?Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.89,0:16:17.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the outer walls of the factory are made of Sea Stone.Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.14,0:16:22.36,Main,,0,0,0,,So strings created by a Devil Fruit user can't cut it...Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:23.96,Main,,0,0,0,,But, look!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:33.61,Main,,0,0,0,,It's starting to be pushed!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.21,0:16:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? That's...Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:37.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:39.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Robot-dono!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.16,0:16:46.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoroland! Topknotland!Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:48.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro, Kin'emon!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:52.33,Main,,0,0,0,,The center of the country is in the direction you just flew from.Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.33,0:16:54.19,Main,,0,0,0,,If you wanna run, you're going the wrong way!Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:58.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We ain't running! We're gonna stop the strings!Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:02.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop them? Oh, I didn't even think about that!Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:05.61,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! That's so cool!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:10.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Until Luffy settles this, we gotta buy some time!Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:14.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:20.24,Captions,,0,0,0,,Downtown Luffy vs. DoflamingoDialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:39.51,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Using the Color of Arms to control the expansion and contraction of his rubber body any way he wants...Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.99,0:17:47.15,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,A harmony of Arming and Rubber, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:17:59.91,Main,,0,0,0,,If I take too much time, Gear Fourth's gonna...Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:08.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You seem like you have excellent grasp of your abilities, but it must be quite the burden.Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:11.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Surely there are some risks.Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:14.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:18.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, how many more seconds will you last?Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:19.01,Main,,0,0,0,,...Double...Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.19,0:18:25.34,Main,,0,0,0,,My strings, however, will never run out!Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:27.06,Main,,0,0,0,,...Culverin!Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:28.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Off-White String!Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.26,0:18:34.99,Main,,0,0,0,,H-How are his strings coming out of the ground?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:38.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you do to this town?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.95,0:18:42.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up, fledgling!Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.13,0:18:51.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Devil Fruit abilities have yet another stage to them, called "Awakening"!Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:02.54,Main,,0,0,0,,The buildings turned into strings!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:10.43,Main,,0,0,0,,In rare instances, an ability will "awaken" and begin to affect things other than its user's body!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:16.75,Main,,0,0,0,,All kinds of things are turning into strings! This doesn't look like the power of a Paramecia!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.75,0:19:20.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Anything that surrounds you, I can turn to string!Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:25.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't even come near me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.87,0:19:40.75,Main,,0,0,0,,And when your strength gives out, my body will have...Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:12.19,Main,,0,0,0,,The moment your Haki gives out, I'll finish you off!Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:18.80,Captions,,980,0,280,,20 Minutes LaterDialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gonna slice us! Run!Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.11,0:20:31.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Grandma!Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.11,0:20:35.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Grandma, stand up! The strings'll cut you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.13,0:20:38.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't...Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:41.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't run anymore...Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.45,0:20:47.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave me here and go on ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:50.83,Main,,0,0,0,,No way, no way! I can't do something like that!Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.51,0:20:56.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't survive this anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:57.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, get up!Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.82,0:21:03.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if I get up, I definitely can't run all the way downtown!Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:10.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody, give us a hand!Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:13.02,Main,,0,0,0,,There are still patients in the hospital!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:15.37,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't carry them all by ourselves! I'm begging you!Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.81,0:21:21.50,Main,,0,0,0,,My son's missing! Has anyone seen him?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:24.99,Main,,0,0,0,,He's wearing a Kuma shirt! He's five years old!Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:27.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Anybody! Have you seen my son?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.59,0:21:36.17,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.27,0:21:38.53,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,We should just give up.Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:43.55,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No matter how far we run, we're still in a cage.Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.55,0:21:45.75,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,We'll all be killed by Doflamingo.Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:48.01,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's easier...Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.40,0:21:50.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,if we just give up.Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.29,0:22:13.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody, please listen to me.Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:15.79,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.79,0:22:20.20,Main,,0,0,0,,the former king of Dressrosa, Riku Dold the Third.Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:24.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.27,0:22:27.09,Main,,0,0,0,,K-King Riku...Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.09,0:22:35.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Currently, our country is trapped within an inescapable bird cage,Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.63,0:22:39.07,Main,,0,0,0,,as part of a game started by the current king, Doflamingo.Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.71,0:22:47.07,Main,,0,0,0,,In addition, that vicious bird cage continues to shrink, carving up the town with it.Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.75,0:22:53.56,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku...Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.56,0:22:56.31,Main,,0,0,0,,All too suddenly, reality befell all of you.Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.39,0:23:00.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I am sure your emotions have not had the chance to catch up to you,Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.07,0:23:05.85,Main,,0,0,0,,and right now you are simply trying to save your own life, or the life of someone else!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.97,0:23:10.85,Main,,0,0,0,,However, this is not a dream!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:14.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Nor is this a tragedy that has begun only today!Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.31,0:23:17.68,Main,,0,0,0,,For a decade,Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:22.49,Main,,0,0,0,,we have lived in this bird cage called "Dressrosa",Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.49,0:23:24.89,Main,,0,0,0,,under the reign of pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.65,0:23:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,For a decade, we lived as puppets manipulated by them.Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.85,0:23:41.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Such is our reality!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.93,0:23:44.39,Main,,0,0,0,,However, that shall soon end!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:50.42,Main,,0,0,0,,The Donquixote Family that we thought nobody could match...Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.42,0:23:55.15,Main,,0,0,0,,...is on the verge of defeat, at the hands of the mighty warriorsDialogue: 0,0:23:55.15,0:23:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,that are in this country by coincidence!Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.47,0:24:00.44,Main,,0,0,0,,The Family's commanders have already fallen!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.44,0:24:01.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.48,0:24:03.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Those commanders were...Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.67,0:24:05.65,Main,,0,0,0,,He's saying they were taken down?Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.65,0:24:08.43,Main,,0,0,0,,The only enemy remaining to be defeated...Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.43,0:24:12.89,Main,,0,0,0,,is the current king of Dressrosa, Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.85,0:24:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,And the one fighting him is the pirate, Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.91,0:24:33.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I believe that he is the man that will destroy this bird cage!Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.95,0:24:39.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Whether he wins or loses, it will be over in less than an hour!Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.29,0:24:42.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Until then, survive! Do whatever it takes!Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.79,0:24:49.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I do not want a single one of you to be crushed by this shrinking country!Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.43,0:24:51.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, keep running!Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.11,0:24:56.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you run out of breath, or if your legs break!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.19,0:25:00.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay alive for just a few more minutes!Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.81,0:25:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,There is still hope!Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.08,0:25:12.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't give up!Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.78,0:25:22.84,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll give it our all, even without help!Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.75,0:25:24.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.62,0:25:27.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's get goin', grandkid! Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.61,0:25:35.55,Main,,0,0,0,,'Kay, Grandma! Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.09,0:25:37.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Me, too!Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:40.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Just like King Riku said...Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:43.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't give up! We're running downtown!Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.39,0:25:44.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Carry the sick!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.95,0:25:46.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Grab those beds!Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.85,0:25:59.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Mommy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.71,0:26:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Survive until the battle ends!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.21,0:26:11.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy's gonna take down Doflamingo for us!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.78,0:26:12.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.27,0:26:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Mingo!Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.27,0:26:27.53,Main,,0,0,0,,About time you dropped dead.Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.11,0:26:31.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm runnin' out of time!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.80,0:26:33.45,Main,,0,0,0,,The whole town's turning to string!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.65,0:26:36.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Billow White!Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.21,0:26:49.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Mingo!Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.47,0:26:57.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blow you away!Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.14,0:27:18.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Mingo!Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.76,0:27:26.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm ending this!Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.16,0:27:31.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.94,0:27:41.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo Bazooka!Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.78,0:28:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Do...Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.48,0:28:19.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.88,0:28:38.00,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing:  Datenshi, Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance:  Datenshi, Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Mr. Luffy  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Translation: Yibis